{"id":"c161","number":161,"title":"不还","label":"第一百六十一章 不还","volumeId":"v3","sourceHeadingParagraph":44144,"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"2029年11月的一个周六，临江迎来入冬之前第一场像样的冷雨。雨势算不上滂沱，从清晨起便淅淅沥沥断断续续，直到午后才织成一片绵密的雨幕。","sourceParagraph":44145},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕睡醒的时候已经九点多。窗外天色蒙着一层灰白的雾霭，隔壁楼顶积攒的雨水顺着排水管，一刻不停地往下淌，嘀嗒的声响隔着玻璃窗隐约传进屋内。今天没有设置闹钟，也没有需要赶点奔赴的行程。","sourceParagraph":44146},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手机屏幕静静亮着，最早的消息来自旼，八点十二分发来：「下雨了。」","sourceParagraph":44147},{"type":"paragraph","text":"隔两分钟又补来一条：「出门记得带伞。」","sourceParagraph":44148},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕蜷在被褥里，盯着屏幕看了片刻，指尖敲击屏幕回复：「知道。」","sourceParagraph":44149},{"type":"paragraph","text":"消息发出还不到一分钟，旼的消息又跳出来。","sourceParagraph":44150},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「醒了？」","sourceParagraph":44151},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「刚醒。」","sourceParagraph":44152},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我还以为你要一觉睡到中午。」","sourceParagraph":44153},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「本来是打算的。」","sourceParagraph":44154},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你接着睡。」","sourceParagraph":44155},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕忍不住弯起唇角笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":44156},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「被你的消息吵醒了。」","sourceParagraph":44157},{"type":"paragraph","text":"那头没有半句抱歉，简简单单丢过来两个字：「活该。」","sourceParagraph":44158},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这一句，许多年前他们也曾说过。具体是哪一日，如今两个人已经不必翻找旧日照片去回溯确认。","sourceParagraph":44159},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕掀开被子起身，顺手把堆在书桌一角昨夜带回来的书稿挪到侧边。正式工作数月，这间出租小屋已经和七月刚刚搬进来的时候截然不同。书架第二层安安稳稳摆着旼送给他的照片盒，旁边错落立着几本正在翻阅的读物。桌面上散落着单位配发的便签纸、校样稿件，还有一支总是忘记扣上笔帽的黑色水笔。窗边的横杆上，垂挂着昨夜洗好晾干的衬衫。屋子没有刻意收拾得一尘不染，维持着普通人居家松弛随意的模样。","sourceParagraph":44161},{"type":"paragraph","text":"十点半，敲门声响起。幕走过去拉开房门，旼站在门外，目光先扫过玄关地面。","sourceParagraph":44162},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我的鞋呢？」","sourceParagraph":44163},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕抬手指向柜子下方的角落。","sourceParagraph":44164},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她弯腰换上那双搁在这里已经一个多月的拖鞋。并不是特意选购的情侣款式，只是从前她来往得频繁，幕随口提过一句要不要留一双鞋，旼应下，便简简单单买了这一双。","sourceParagraph":44165},{"type":"paragraph","text":"进门之后，她把帆布包搁在沙发边角，那只蓝色的相机也一并带了过来。幕瞥见，眉梢微微扬起。","sourceParagraph":44166},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你今天不是休息日吗。」","sourceParagraph":44167},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「休息日就不能带相机出来？」","sourceParagraph":44168},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「当然可以。」","sourceParagraph":44169},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼脱下沾着雨汽的外套，随手搭在沙发靠背，眼底带着一点促狭的笑意。","sourceParagraph":44170},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么，又怕我对着你拍照？」","sourceParagraph":44171},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我没有怕。」","sourceParagraph":44172},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你干嘛多问这一句。」","sourceParagraph":44173},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕一时语塞，找不出话来辩驳。旼看着他窘迫的模样，浅浅笑出声。","sourceParagraph":44174},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中午两个人没有外出觅食。冰箱里还存着前几日采购的食材。幕做菜的手艺平平，旼也好不到哪里去，最后分工下来，一人洗菜，一人掌刀切配。","sourceParagraph":44176},{"type":"paragraph","text":"锅里的油温骤然升高，第一把葱花丢进去，滋啦一声腾起大片油星。旼下意识往后缩了半步，身体微微后仰避开飞溅的热油。","sourceParagraph":44177},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕侧过头看她。","sourceParagraph":44178},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有这么吓人吗。」","sourceParagraph":44179},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「油会溅出来啊。」","sourceParagraph":44180},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你都站得这么远了还怕？」","sourceParagraph":44181},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「觉得行那换你来。」","sourceParagraph":44182},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕接过锅铲上手操作。十来分钟过后，第一盘菜盛出锅，入口尝起来盐分明显偏重。","sourceParagraph":44183},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼夹起一筷子，蹙了蹙眉。","sourceParagraph":44184},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「盐到底是谁放多的。」","sourceParagraph":44185},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕顿了顿，目光飘忽。","sourceParagraph":44186},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是你。」","sourceParagraph":44187},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我就只撒了一点点。」","sourceParagraph":44188},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我也补撒了一点。」","sourceParagraph":44189},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人对视一眼，才反应过来原来是前后重复放了盐。","sourceParagraph":44190},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把玻璃杯往他面前推了推。","sourceParagraph":44191},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「凑合吃吧。」","sourceParagraph":44192},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低头扒了一口饭菜。","sourceParagraph":44193},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「其实还能接受。」","sourceParagraph":44194},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你现在对我们俩的标准已经降得这么低了？」","sourceParagraph":44195},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是对我自己，是对我们两个人。」","sourceParagraph":44196},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼被他这句话逗得低笑出声。那一盘偏咸的菜，最后还是被两个人吃完。","sourceParagraph":44197},{"type":"paragraph","text":"午后外面的雨依旧没有停歇。旼挪到窗边的位置，低头翻阅下周单位研讨要用的影像素材；幕坐在桌子另一侧，埋头修改书稿校样。","sourceParagraph":44199},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他们已经很少再像本科时代那样，隔着图书馆宽大的长桌对坐。如今家里这张书桌尺寸狭小，两台电脑的电源线纠缠在一起，偶尔要伸手去拿水杯，还得先轻轻把对方的椅子往里面推上几分。","sourceParagraph":44200},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下午两点多，沉寂许久的六人群弹出一连串消息。","sourceParagraph":44201},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「今天谁不用上班？」","sourceParagraph":44202},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「周六啊。」","sourceParagraph":44203},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「我当然知道是周六。」","sourceParagraph":44204},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈屿：「那你瞎打听什么。」","sourceParagraph":44205},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「做个小调查而已。」","sourceParagraph":44206},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚：「你该不会在加班吧。」","sourceParagraph":44207},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「没有加班。」","sourceParagraph":44208},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚：「那就是闲得发慌。」","sourceParagraph":44209},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「我就是刚知道阿遥今天还要加班。」","sourceParagraph":44210},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「所以跑来骚扰我们几个。」","sourceParagraph":44211},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「没错。」","sourceParagraph":44212},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把手机屏幕转向幕，让他看见聊天记录。","sourceParagraph":44213},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕扫过几行文字。","sourceParagraph":44214},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「别搭理他就好了。」","sourceParagraph":44215},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼手指已经敲完消息发送出去：「我这边在忙。」","sourceParagraph":44216},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没过片刻幕的手机也跟着震动，他回复：「旼现在在我这里。」","sourceParagraph":44217},{"type":"paragraph","text":"群聊安静停滞三秒钟。","sourceParagraph":44218},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「噢。」","sourceParagraph":44219},{"type":"paragraph","text":"紧跟着一条：「打扰了。」","sourceParagraph":44220},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈屿：「总算学会看眼色了。」","sourceParagraph":44221},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「我本来就会。」","sourceParagraph":44222},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「并不会。」","sourceParagraph":44223},{"type":"paragraph","text":"群里又热热闹闹拌起嘴。阿遥、苏晴并不在线。岁月悠悠流转许多年，这个聊天群依旧还是当初六个人。并不会因为谁开启恋爱关系，就强行把所有人的生活完全裹挟在一起。一部分情绪分享留在群内，一部分细碎的相处藏在群外，一切都顺其自然。","sourceParagraph":44224},{"type":"paragraph","text":"三点半，旼合上笔记本电脑。幕还埋着头，剩最后两页校样没有看完，她没有出声催促，起身移步走到书架跟前，伸手抽出那只照片盒。","sourceParagraph":44226},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕闻声抬眼望过来。","sourceParagraph":44227},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你拿它做什么。」","sourceParagraph":44228},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「翻开来看看。」","sourceParagraph":44229},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那可是你的东西。」","sourceParagraph":44230},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕话说出口，又立刻改口。","sourceParagraph":44231},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是你送给我的东西。」","sourceParagraph":44232},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼这才掀开盒盖。盒内三十六张照片依旧维持旧日的排序。第一张拍摄于大一九月图书馆三楼，最末一张，日期是2026年六月三日图书馆门前。经年流转，相纸边缘早已不复刚打印出来时的挺括坚硬。其中有几张，幕从前反复翻看，顺序曾经被碰乱，之后又被他一张张重新归位。","sourceParagraph":44233},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼指尖轻轻划过相片，翻到第三张停下。","sourceParagraph":44234},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你是不是经常拿出来翻看？」","sourceParagraph":44235},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「偶尔才会。」","sourceParagraph":44236},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我记得当初的顺序不是这样。」","sourceParagraph":44237},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕微微一滞。","sourceParagraph":44238},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「之前不小心整盒打翻掉落过。」","sourceParagraph":44239},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真的？」","sourceParagraph":44240},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":44241},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「全部相片都掉出来了？」","sourceParagraph":44242},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「掉出来一半。」","sourceParagraph":44243},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼忍不住扬起笑意。","sourceParagraph":44244},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你还一张张排回去了。」","sourceParagraph":44245},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「相片背面都写了拍摄时间。」","sourceParagraph":44246},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「有几张只标注了月份。」","sourceParagraph":44247},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就凭着记忆大致归置。」","sourceParagraph":44248},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼没有继续取笑他，继续往后翻阅。翻到最后一张，画面里面幕身着学士服回过头，彼时的旼就站在原地举着相机。距离那个夏日，一晃已经过去三年有余。","sourceParagraph":44249},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻声开口：「你还记得那天我说了什么吗。」","sourceParagraph":44250},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕缓缓作答：「原话现在已经记不清了。」","sourceParagraph":44251},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「记性倒是挺清楚。」","sourceParagraph":44252},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「相片背面没有写下那句话。」","sourceParagraph":44253},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以呢。」","sourceParagraph":44254},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以是我自己记在脑子里的。」","sourceParagraph":44255},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬起脑袋看向他，幕也正望向她，两个人相视，浅浅一笑。","sourceParagraph":44256},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把相片收回盒子，搁回书架。忽然弯腰从相机包里面取出相机。","sourceParagraph":44258},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看向她。","sourceParagraph":44259},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你不是刚看完工作素材？」","sourceParagraph":44260},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「素材已经看完了。」","sourceParagraph":44261},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以要干嘛。」","sourceParagraph":44262},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她已经摘下镜头保护盖。幕身子微微靠在桌边。\n「拍我？」","sourceParagraph":44263},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":44264},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天有什么值得拍的。」","sourceParagraph":44265},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼没有回应。幕身上只是一件普通深色毛衣，居家的头发随意松散，桌面摆着中午喝水留下的玻璃杯，窗外天色灰蒙蒙，室内的光线也称不上理想。","sourceParagraph":44266},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼举起相机，幕安安静静没有躲闪。「咔嚓」一声，快门响起。","sourceParagraph":44267},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕挑眉。","sourceParagraph":44268},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就一张？」","sourceParagraph":44269},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼低头预览屏幕。","sourceParagraph":44270},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「再来一张。」","sourceParagraph":44271},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕笑起来。","sourceParagraph":44272},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「以前你拍我一张就完事。」","sourceParagraph":44273},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「谁定下的规矩。」","sourceParagraph":44274},{"type":"paragraph","text":"第二次快门声响，这一瞬幕刚好侧过脸庞。","sourceParagraph":44275},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼放下相机。","sourceParagraph":44276},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好了。」","sourceParagraph":44277},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕走上前凑过去看取景屏幕，第一张是端正的正面，第二张脸庞稍稍偏开。","sourceParagraph":44278},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「哪张效果更好。」","sourceParagraph":44279},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还没有筛选。」","sourceParagraph":44280},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那这两张相片要放在哪里。」","sourceParagraph":44281},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":44282},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「归到新的部分。」","sourceParagraph":44283},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕愣了愣。","sourceParagraph":44284},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要买新的照片盒？」","sourceParagraph":44285},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「暂时没有盒子。」","sourceParagraph":44286},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那要怎么存放。」","sourceParagraph":44287},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「以后再想办法。」","sourceParagraph":44288},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕失笑。","sourceParagraph":44289},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你又开始卖关子。」","sourceParagraph":44290},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼把相机妥善收好。","sourceParagraph":44291},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「旧的那一盒故事已经结束了。」","sourceParagraph":44292},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯。」","sourceParagraph":44293},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「新的片段，犯不上急着立刻整理归档。」","sourceParagraph":44294},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻轻点头，没有追问如今已经积攒下多少张。","sourceParagraph":44295},{"type":"paragraph","text":"有些珍贵的细碎瞬间，已经不必刻意清点数目。","sourceParagraph":44296},{"type":"paragraph","text":"傍晚五点，外面的雨势反倒又大上几分。两个人原本计划出门逛超市。","sourceParagraph":44298},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼站在玄关，透过玻璃窗望向雨雾笼罩的街道。","sourceParagraph":44299},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还要出去吗。」","sourceParagraph":44300},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「冰箱里面几乎空了。」","sourceParagraph":44301},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不然直接点外卖。」","sourceParagraph":44302},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕拿起手机翻看两家店铺。周末遇上雨天，两家平台预估配送时长都格外漫长。","sourceParagraph":44303},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还是我们自己跑一趟吧。」","sourceParagraph":44304},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼颔首。幕伸手去拿外套，旼一边弯腰换鞋，语气平平淡淡开口：「我的租房合约明年七月到期。」","sourceParagraph":44305},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕拿外套的动作顿住一瞬。","sourceParagraph":44306},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我的也是那个时间。」","sourceParagraph":44307},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我知道。」","sourceParagraph":44308},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你什么时候知道的。」","sourceParagraph":44309},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你签租房合同那一天跟我提过。」","sourceParagraph":44310},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕自己都快要遗忘这件往事。","sourceParagraph":44311},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「所以你的意思是？」","sourceParagraph":44312},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼系好鞋带，神态自然，就如同随口聊起一桩寻常琐事。","sourceParagraph":44313},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「等到那时候，我们可以一起看看房子吗。」","sourceParagraph":44314},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕站在原地，没有立刻给出答复。并非内心摇摆犹豫，只是这句对话，一如他们过往所有重大抉择，没有郑重其事的开场，没有谁刻意抛出一句“我们来谈谈未来”，就这么在弯腰穿鞋的间隙轻飘飘说出口。","sourceParagraph":44315},{"type":"paragraph","text":"片刻之后幕应声：「好。」","sourceParagraph":44316},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼抬眼看向他。","sourceParagraph":44317},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你都不问想住在哪一片？」","sourceParagraph":44318},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「到时候看两个人通勤再权衡。」","sourceParagraph":44319},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「房间要几间。」","sourceParagraph":44320},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「看我们的预算。」","sourceParagraph":44321},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那你有没有什么硬性要求？」","sourceParagraph":44322},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕认真思索片刻。","sourceParagraph":44323},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「要有足够的地方放书。」","sourceParagraph":44324},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼接话：「我的相机器材也得有位置。」","sourceParagraph":44325},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那书和相机的收纳区域各占一边。」","sourceParagraph":44326},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「凭什么要这么分配。」","sourceParagraph":44327},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕唇角扬起笑意。","sourceParagraph":44328},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「真到看房的时候再商量。」","sourceParagraph":44329},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻点头：「行。」","sourceParagraph":44330},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没有人说出一句“这样就代表要永远在一起”。只是约定好，明年七月租期结束之后，试着把两处独立的居所，合并成同一个家。未来第一次有了一个具体、朴素、触手可及的共同地址。","sourceParagraph":44331},{"type":"paragraph","text":"出门的时候，幕一只手拎垃圾袋，另一只手提着购物布袋。旼随手从玄关柜上捞起一把雨伞，黑色伞面，并不是大一时那一把——那一把早已经坏掉丢弃，这一把是他研究生毕业之后添置的。","sourceParagraph":44333},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼拇指按下开关，伞面“砰”地一下撑开。她先一步踏出单元门。幕转身关门落锁，手指又确认一遍钥匙揣在口袋。等他抬眼，旼已经往楼道出口走出两步，哗哗的雨声扑面而来。","sourceParagraph":44334},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她回过头望向身后的幕，嘴唇轻轻动了动，只简短唤一声：「过来。」","sourceParagraph":44335},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕小跑进去那片伞下空间。","sourceParagraph":44336},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你的肩膀淋湿了。」","sourceParagraph":44337},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你那一侧也沾到雨。」","sourceParagraph":44338},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我们把伞放到正中间。」","sourceParagraph":44339},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人一同调整伞的角度，到头来谁的肩膀都没能完全躲开雨珠。","sourceParagraph":44340},{"type":"paragraph","text":"超市距离住处不算远，湿漉漉的路面铺满路灯破碎的倒影。来往车辆驶过积水路面溅起水花，两个人下意识一齐往伞的内侧缩了缩。幕手上拎着袋子，动作慢了半步，旼伸手轻轻拽住他的袖口。","sourceParagraph":44341},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「走快一点。」","sourceParagraph":44342},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「知道。」","sourceParagraph":44343},{"type":"paragraph","text":"路口红灯亮起，两个人停下脚步。幕忽然开口。","sourceParagraph":44344},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天你还过来吗。」","sourceParagraph":44345},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼侧过头看他。","sourceParagraph":44346},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「今天不是才见过。」","sourceParagraph":44347},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天和今天本来就不是同一天。」","sourceParagraph":44348},{"type":"paragraph","text":"这句说辞，和数月之前地铁上的对话几乎一模一样。","sourceParagraph":44349},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼浅浅笑起来。\n「上午我有事要处理。」","sourceParagraph":44350},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那下午呢。」","sourceParagraph":44351},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「看情况再说。」","sourceParagraph":44352},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕点点头：「行。」","sourceParagraph":44353},{"type":"paragraph","text":"绿灯亮起，两人穿过马路。走进超市，雨伞收起来套进门口的塑料防水袋。旼推着购物车，幕掏出手机备忘录，清单上面简简单单四项：鸡蛋、青菜、牛奶、纸巾。","sourceParagraph":44355},{"type":"paragraph","text":"等到结账的时候，购物车里又多出十几样零零碎碎的物件。幕低头看向车里。\n「饼干是谁拿的。」","sourceParagraph":44356},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼：「是你。」","sourceParagraph":44357},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「酸奶呢。」","sourceParagraph":44358},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「也是你。」","sourceParagraph":44359},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那这个呢。」","sourceParagraph":44360},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我拿的。」","sourceParagraph":44361},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人互相打趣推诿几番，索性不再追究是谁拿的。","sourceParagraph":44362},{"type":"paragraph","text":"结账台前，幕站得更靠前，付款码率先扫过机器。旼开口：\n「我把钱转给你。」","sourceParagraph":44363},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕望向她。\n「不用。」","sourceParagraph":44364},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么。」","sourceParagraph":44365},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「下次换你来买就好了。」","sourceParagraph":44366},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那到头来还不是我付钱。」","sourceParagraph":44367},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「下次的事等到下次再说。」","sourceParagraph":44368},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼略一思索，把手机重新塞回外套口袋。","sourceParagraph":44369},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好吧。」","sourceParagraph":44370},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她没有立刻掰算清楚这一趟自己该分摊多少金额，幕同样没有。","sourceParagraph":44371},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走出超市，雨势稍稍减弱。旼重新撑开雨伞，一只手提重量较轻的购物袋，幕拎另外两个沉甸甸的袋子。","sourceParagraph":44373},{"type":"paragraph","text":"往回走的路上，旼忽然出声：","sourceParagraph":44374},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你现在还记账吗。」","sourceParagraph":44375},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕一开始以为她说的是刚刚的采购。","sourceParagraph":44376},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「记什么？」","sourceParagraph":44377},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「记那些欠。」","sourceParagraph":44378},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕的脚步微微放缓。这个字眼，已经很久没有被直白提起。旼目光落向前方雨雾笼罩的街道，并没有转头看向他的脸。","sourceParagraph":44379},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕沉吟片刻。","sourceParagraph":44380},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「工作上面的报销依旧会记账。」","sourceParagraph":44381},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼转过脑袋瞥他一眼。","sourceParagraph":44382},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「谁问你报销。」","sourceParagraph":44383},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":44384},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那种账本，早就不再记了。」","sourceParagraph":44385},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「什么时候开始不记的。」","sourceParagraph":44386},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我说不上确切时间。」","sourceParagraph":44387},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「又是不知道。」","sourceParagraph":44388},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「是真的没有一个明确节点。」","sourceParagraph":44389},{"type":"paragraph","text":"他讲不出一个干净利落的日期。或许是很早的某一日，变化悄无声息发生。不知从什么时候起，他越来越少点开那份清单，后来文档名字改成《不还》，再往后，连《不还》，也不再新增条目。","sourceParagraph":44390},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼问道：「旧的那份记录还留着吗。」","sourceParagraph":44391},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还存着。」","sourceParagraph":44392},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「为什么不删掉。」","sourceParagraph":44393},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕轻声回答：「毕竟实实在在写下来过。」","sourceParagraph":44394},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻颔首，没有继续追问。","sourceParagraph":44395},{"type":"paragraph","text":"走了一小段，旼换手拎袋子。幕伸出手。","sourceParagraph":44396},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「给我来拿。」","sourceParagraph":44397},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没事，不重。」","sourceParagraph":44398},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你还要举着伞。」","sourceParagraph":44399},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还扛得住。」","sourceParagraph":44400},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕没有伸手硬抢。","sourceParagraph":44401},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那我们接着走。」","sourceParagraph":44402},{"type":"paragraph","text":"两个人就这样继续穿行在雨里。","sourceParagraph":44403},{"type":"paragraph","text":"快要走到小区楼下，六人群又弹出消息。周鸣发来：「阿遥下班了，我先走啦。」","sourceParagraph":44405},{"type":"paragraph","text":"陈屿：「下午不是还说她加班。」","sourceParagraph":44406},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「现在加班结束。」","sourceParagraph":44407},{"type":"paragraph","text":"程野：「没人关心你去哪。」","sourceParagraph":44408},{"type":"paragraph","text":"周鸣：「跟大家通知一声。」","sourceParagraph":44409},{"type":"paragraph","text":"沈砚：「收到。」","sourceParagraph":44410},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕单手划动屏幕扫一眼，没有回复。","sourceParagraph":44411},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼问：「谁的消息。」","sourceParagraph":44412},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「周鸣。」","sourceParagraph":44413},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「发生什么了。」","sourceParagraph":44414},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「阿遥下班，他要过去。」","sourceParagraph":44415},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼笑了笑。","sourceParagraph":44416},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还挺忙活。」","sourceParagraph":44417},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕把手机收回口袋。","sourceParagraph":44418},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「陈屿不知道在忙什么。」","sourceParagraph":44419},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「程野也不清楚。」","sourceParagraph":44420},{"type":"paragraph","text":"没有人需要时时刻刻掌握每一位朋友当下的行踪。","sourceParagraph":44421},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大家只知道，真的需要的时候，聊天群依旧会亮起。","sourceParagraph":44422},{"type":"paragraph","text":"抵达单元楼下，旼没有急着收拢雨伞。屋檐边缘雨水一串串垂落。幕把两只购物袋归拢到一只手上，腾出另一只手准备掏钥匙。旼静静站在一旁等候。","sourceParagraph":44424},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕侧过头看向她。","sourceParagraph":44425},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「怎么了。」","sourceParagraph":44426},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":44427},{"type":"paragraph","text":"如今的旼，已经不会凡事都追着问到底。","sourceParagraph":44428},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「开门吧。」","sourceParagraph":44429},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕笑了笑，钥匙插进锁孔。正要转动，旼忽然轻轻唤他一声：「幕。」","sourceParagraph":44430},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「嗯？」","sourceParagraph":44431},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她静静望着他，停顿两秒，仿佛有千言万语涌到嘴边，到最后，却只淡淡一句。","sourceParagraph":44432},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":44433},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕看向她。","sourceParagraph":44434},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「就只是想叫一下我的名字？」","sourceParagraph":44435},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼轻轻点头。","sourceParagraph":44436},{"type":"paragraph","text":"许许多多的过往片段浮上心头：毫无来由地呼唤一个名字；跨越路途奔赴相见；拍下一张不必上交汇报的相片；记下一桩不必偿还的人情；坦然接过别人递过来的水；拜托家人邮寄一箱厚厚的书；疲惫的时候直白说出想要谁陪伴；遇到无解的问题坦然承认自己不知道；当两个选项各有千秋的时候，把“我想要和你在一起”也纳入权衡的理由。","sourceParagraph":44437},{"type":"paragraph","text":"单独拆开来看，全都是微不足道的小事。甚至很难界定，究竟是从哪一件事开始，幕真正完成蜕变。他只是慢慢不再反复掂量：我需要拿什么东西，用来交换眼前的这份善意与陪伴。","sourceParagraph":44438},{"type":"paragraph","text":"门锁咔嗒一声开启，幕先把采购的东西拎进屋。旼站在门外收拢雨伞，雨水顺着伞骨滴滴答答往下淌，她手腕轻轻甩了两下，这个细微的动作，和很多年前图书馆雨天的模样隐隐重合。","sourceParagraph":44440},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕望着她。","sourceParagraph":44441},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼察觉到他的视线。","sourceParagraph":44442},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「看什么。」","sourceParagraph":44443},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「没什么。」","sourceParagraph":44444},{"type":"paragraph","text":"她把伞彻底折合。","sourceParagraph":44445},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「你今天说好多句没什么。」","sourceParagraph":44446},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「还好吧。」","sourceParagraph":44447},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼迈步跨过门槛经过他身边，直接把湿漉漉的伞柄塞到幕的手心。","sourceParagraph":44448},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「拿着。」","sourceParagraph":44449},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕下意识接住，冰凉潮湿的触感传到掌心。旼已经弯腰更换室内拖鞋。","sourceParagraph":44450},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕低头看着手里的雨伞。若是放在从前，别人这样把物件交到他手上，他第一反应总会琢磨：这是谁的东西？什么时候需要归还？下一次我要做点什么作为补偿。","sourceParagraph":44451},{"type":"paragraph","text":"而这一刻，这些念头一丝一毫都没有冒出来。他只是安安静静把雨伞立进门边的雨具桶。","sourceParagraph":44452},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼换好鞋抬眼望向他。","sourceParagraph":44453},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「明天到底要不要见。」","sourceParagraph":44454},{"type":"paragraph","text":"幕扬起笑意。","sourceParagraph":44455},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「不是你说看情况。」","sourceParagraph":44456},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「我现在问你想不想。」","sourceParagraph":44457},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「想见。」","sourceParagraph":44458},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「那就下午。」","sourceParagraph":44459},{"type":"paragraph","text":"「好。」","sourceParagraph":44460},{"type":"paragraph","text":"旼转身往屋子深处走去。幕立在玄关，屋外的冷雨依旧绵绵不绝。他恍惚记起许多年前另一个落雨天，同样一把撑开的伞，旼往前走出两步，要唤他，还会再叫第二次。","sourceParagraph":44461},{"type":"paragraph","text":"而今天，她只唤过一次。","sourceParagraph":44462},{"type":"paragraph","text":"而他，已经主动朝她走了过去。","sourceParagraph":44463},{"type":"paragraph","text":"（不还 全文完）","sourceParagraph":44465},{"type":"image","assetId":"image154","sourceParagraph":44466}],"textChars":6022,"hanChars":4971,"imageCount":1}